{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c1e5790f8a7bd9325f1b1809245644ce9393af538fafee8c87797b581c106930", "ja": "（美奈子の初公演が無事に終わった。これから、\n今まで以上に、活躍してもらいたいところだが……）", "zh": "（美奈子的首次公演顺利结束了。\n我希望她未来的表现能比以往更加亮眼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "39369f617a4abb25bb39a9bed638bd513180b65c1877c46fa9b2498ffedafa19", "ja": "えっ！？\nわ、私のことをもっと知りたいですか？", "zh": "咦！？\n想、想更了解我是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cfb305a67266ce3d08edb3c812b085261fd3ad43040978bb4c0901c25f1dfe79", "ja": "ああ、そうなんだ。今後の美奈子を\nプロデュースしていく、参考になればと思って。", "zh": "没错，作为今后培育美奈子的参考，\n我想多了解你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8c6034893582101d975282886b3958f956e10a6dbbd25794b4cef661392abeef", "ja": "美奈子は普段どんなことをしてるのかとか、\nそういうことを教えてくれないか？", "zh": "方便跟我聊聊\n美奈子你平常都在做些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "0fac90559cd9ea18a141ba72d366f0b8330d82019a66824c82bc066410be5f5d", "ja": "あっ……なんだ、そういう意味だったんですね！\nえへへ、ちょっとびっくりしちゃいました。", "zh": "啊……什么嘛，原来你是这个意思啊！\n嘿嘿，有点被你吓到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "912b4a77ca5449bb0db6a9e8146cea09742116b4fbf428819be948ff896a953c", "ja": "う～ん、けど急にそう言われても、何を話せば……。\nあっ、そうだ！　それなら、私の家に来ませんか？", "zh": "嗯……但突然这么问，我也不晓得该怎么说……\n啊，我想到了！这样的话，你要不要来我家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "3f24bceb95b8d1ced1189df9bff9df076eb8f00ad27caecc15996c9a79babc8a", "ja": "私だけじゃなく、家族からも話を聞けば、\n色々な私を知ってもらえると思いますから！", "zh": "除了问我，也可以问问我的家人，\n这样你应该能更了解不同面向的我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9c058f3b8f5ec0427db2fdb3c5a09d7c10a4ea29847ff3086cddcccb1660babd", "ja": "それはありがたいけど……\n急に行って、迷惑じゃないか？", "zh": "那真是感激不尽……\n但我突然去拜访，不会打扰到你们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "4b7c7db81a717d67badcb622cd3b7bd028415e0252df7a79fb2fc2235e524ff8", "ja": "大丈夫です！\nお客様なら、佐竹飯店はいつでも大歓迎ですよ♪", "zh": "不用担心！\n佐竹饭店随时都欢迎客人上门♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1009_p", "source_sha256": "26b39e2df2e62d3b21f1e58712ae1d62fbbe3a7d76522ba71fe8fa92447dc2a5", "ja": "佐竹飯店……？", "zh": "佐竹饭店……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "27109f96807e21b6c7f95f97c796d5534673ea0efd839292c4f4d125b555986b", "ja": "到着しました！\n{$P$}さん、ここが私の家です♪", "zh": "我们到了！\n{$P$}先生，这里就是我家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1011_p", "source_sha256": "aa3ce2fd7bab962c818c4af2764702b58ecb0539d61fe65c20bf1215dcc2a96c", "ja": "佐竹飯店……\nそうか、美奈子の家は中華料理屋さんだったのか。", "zh": "佐竹饭店……\n原来美奈子的家是中式餐厅啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "1fe29c156b46b053054aa3098a5bf9cd060dc7a5c612b9b11f096db6e1dbdde7", "ja": "えへへ、そうなんですよ～。自分で言うのも\nなんですけど、うちの料理は絶品ですよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，没错～虽然是自卖自夸，\n但我家的料理堪称一绝喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "f9d96a3124d564636a86e99e25f093c2c78b3b1026d8d563bb1bbb6a22173ab5", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}さん、\n紹介しますね。私の両親と、弟です！", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生，\n跟你介绍一下，这是我爸妈，还有弟弟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1014_minakohaha", "source_sha256": "ee4e991d37d5fca4f0916867b7960d0e14d4e21d3fbecf3ad0b163349cc20f1a", "ja": "まぁ、プロデューサーさん！\nいつもうちの美奈子がお世話になってます～！", "zh": "哎呀，制作人先生！\n我们家的美奈子受你照顾了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1015_minakotiti", "source_sha256": "09e022640b0316730ccf770700aee0dd0f9117377c93a1fe9feb5c6e66a980bc", "ja": "美奈子の父です。\n自分の家と思って、気楽に寛いでいってください！", "zh": "我是美奈子的父亲。\n请把这当自己家，放轻松就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b95956b0a1ffd1b24870d08d2b96727bafcf6acccdd589624c0b1a81548af32a", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "好的，非常感谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5c91ba7654a0fb0e431c74bb39f71e4dd8a6b237dc2bc2bcc33c36349e65e6f7", "ja": "（ご両親も弟さんも、笑顔が美奈子と似てる。\nやっぱり家族なんだな……）", "zh": "（美奈子的父母跟弟弟，笑起来都跟她好像。\n果然是一家人呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "1ce72721b36becfeba4603f7e3b1d3f974b4464f0816b7eef2b06e6d52a54725", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nここまで移動してきて、お腹が空きましたよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n从剧场过来这里，肚子应该饿了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "2ff532a8697f89c2166d8b13de6d1167681fff90822cb5322a9e012c72395c79", "ja": "待っててください！\nすぐに料理をお持ちしますから、中へどうぞ♪", "zh": "你等我一下喔！\n我马上端餐点过来，你先里面请坐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4d5bee60c771c2f6e02f6d644c6afd4289a4a5a4944cbe5840ad0ec374581486", "ja": "え、料理？　いや、俺は話を……。", "zh": "咦？餐点？呃不，我只是要来问……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "e8a3e4ec545ef0702b52388ac90d248ca9f721a721ae8463fb2928632e6809f9", "ja": "遠慮しないでください！　さあさあ♪", "zh": "用不着客气啦！来来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1022_minakoototo", "source_sha256": "83b94d1192eea3c3df3ebbc525fd1f14914b962ea1ca530c877bc11337e17f14", "ja": "うちの料理はすっごく美味しいんだよ！\nプロデューサーのお兄ちゃん、食べていくといいよ！", "zh": "我家的餐点真的超级好吃喔！\n制作人大哥哥，你就品尝一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1023_p", "source_sha256": "02ebfe9a6b886ea6306cd25a5b981b7794753267ea018456fafc2220a8863c79", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nじゃあ少しだけ……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n那我就吃一点点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1024_p", "source_sha256": "6cd07d02123f15eeb7e459ee31a3fc4dae4617b3d220e9455fe734c95728bdb9", "ja": "（結局、大量の料理を振る舞われてしまった。\nすごく美味しかったけど、お腹が苦しい……）", "zh": "（结果他们招待我吃了一顿大餐。\n虽然非常好吃，但我吃得好撑……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "a163c7588e442ef54825f859d253a08426b81fc9d16f03e1a3c77762f14b32f6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、すみません。\nみんなで話しかけちゃって……うるさかったですよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，真是不好意思。\n一群人围着你这边一句那边一句的……肯定很吵对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1026_p", "source_sha256": "ec15a24ffa3724dd289c1cec12604855d3cbedc39828c12e38b6fa75c5b4245b", "ja": "いや、そんなことないよ。\n色々な話を聞けて、今後の参考になったし。", "zh": "不不，没这回事。\n我问到了不少事情，都对今后很有帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1027_p", "source_sha256": "576be8b47a7d9b19665109d0818d9e47de903d0243bb9c684061a57a1c26e0fa", "ja": "素敵なご両親だな。美奈子のことを見守るだけでなく、\n心から応援してくれていることが伝わってきたよ。", "zh": "你的父母真的很棒呢。\n我感受得到，他们不仅是关注，还打从心底支持你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "267ffccc2ba6f19b8eaa43916b1bb2b042aa871a448357b0ad6ba24528183a85", "ja": "えへへ……♪\n私、両親みたいな関係が理想なんです！", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪\n我理想中的关系就是像爸妈那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "cd309b5b5cbd25a61ee8885f5909d4e5dcd330be256b9862f22f0c41ce492dbc", "ja": "お互いに支え合って、\n大変なことも一緒に乗り越えていける……。", "zh": "彼此相互扶持，\n遇上困境也能一起克服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "e674c9653d5ddc4434b340a7ae0683fb6b601efced0a504eaebada3a473ee76e", "ja": "私もいつか、そんな人と出会えたらな～……なんて♪\nあっ、今はアイドルのお仕事が第一！ですけど！", "zh": "我希望自己有一天也能遇到这样的人……开玩笑的♪\n啊，但我现在要把偶像的工作摆第一！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1031_p", "source_sha256": "8f347778b71bc9d130075b79217a01c836da5c146b158b82401d8792dd118fb6", "ja": "はは、そうしてくれると助かるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，你能这么做就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1032_p", "source_sha256": "a81b0fd110fa8fd5ec9b4a2d8742d343d8ed44f2506194d0f25b45ec581d3ce8", "ja": "弟さんも、お姉ちゃんをすごく応援してたな。\n元気ないい子だ。", "zh": "你弟弟也很支持你呢～\n是个有活力的乖孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1033_019min", "source_sha256": "b0c288f2d8f09f1a84da6e898d70d2a5332d1d810295d871cad58470a3f1f7e7", "ja": "はい！　とってもいい子なんですよ。\nいつも自分から、お店の手伝いをしてくれますし……。", "zh": "对啊！他真的非常乖巧，\n总是主动帮忙店里的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1034_019min", "source_sha256": "d5e0afbd1f86e8612d2ea4bc49d2c488823aff397201adc5cb37d0cfbc094205", "ja": "小さい頃は、体が弱くて、心配だったんですけど……\n今は、あんなに元気になってくれたんですよ。", "zh": "其实我弟小时候体弱多病，很让人担心……\n不过他现在已经变得那样健康又活泼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1035_p", "source_sha256": "e922d1b4a1433f613b4dc4726b16b7be80e15e7f387434c33c2fe25ebd08ecbe", "ja": "そうだったのか……。\nきっと美奈子が、一生懸命世話をしてあげたからだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n我想这一定是多亏了美奈子拚命照顾他吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_019min_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_004_1036_019min", "source_sha256": "21c478e656f9567a58cc98d0603d034045b9223c7cbc56987d393e6896240fbf", "ja": "えへへ……♪　私、たくさん食べて、\nみんな笑顔でいられるのが一番だって思うんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪我觉得大家能够在一起\n和乐融融地大快朵颐，就是最棒的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
